==================================================
PHASE 2 GOAL — BUILD THE PATIENT CASE RAG
==================================================

Implement the first REAL RAG pipeline.

Architecture:

DDXPlus Patient
      ↓
PatientRepresentation
      ↓
Patient text representation
      ↓
Embedding model
      ↓
Vector database
      ↓
Retrieve similar TRAINING patients
      ↓
Return similar cases + similarity scores + metadata

For now, DO NOT implement:
- multi-agent orchestration
- LangGraph
- human feedback
- medication agent
- diagnostic agent
- medical knowledge RAG
- LLM generation

Those will come after this phase.

The purpose of Phase 2 is to create a clean, tested Patient Case Retrieval system that we can later plug into agents.

