==================================================
2. CREATE PATIENT INGESTION
==================================================

Create:

rag/patient_ingestion.py

Responsibilities:

- Read ONLY the DDXPlus TRAIN split.
- Use the existing DDXPlusParser.
- Never index validation or test patients.
- Never index PATHOLOGY.
- Never index DIFFERENTIAL_DIAGNOSIS.
- Never put evaluation labels into the vector payload.
- Convert PatientRepresentation into a deterministic textual representation.

Example:

Patient:
Age: 45
Sex: Female

Symptoms / clinical evidence:
- ...
- ...

Antecedents:
- ...

Initial evidence:
- ...

Unlisted findings are not assumed absent.

Each indexed document must contain:

{
    "patient_id": ...,
    "split": "train",
    "text": ...,
    "source": ...
}

The payload must NOT contain:
- PATHOLOGY
- DIFFERENTIAL_DIAGNOSIS
- ground_truth_pathology
- diagnosis labels

Add explicit tests proving that these fields never enter the indexed patient document.

