==================================================
5. CREATE PATIENT CASE RETRIEVER
==================================================

Create:

rag/patient_retriever.py

Implement:

class PatientCaseRetriever:

    retrieve(patient_text, top_k=5)

It should:

1. Embed the query patient.
2. Search ONLY the training patient collection.
3. Return the top-k most similar cases.
4. Preserve similarity scores.
5. Preserve patient IDs and source metadata.
6. Never return validation/test records.

Return a structured result such as:

[
    {
        "patient_id": "...",
        "score": 0.87,
        "text": "...",
        "source": "..."
    }
]

Do not interpret similarity as diagnostic probability.

